@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.2  Component Maintenance and Service (QP.17 / QP.17A) — Activity
|Stores|
start
:Receive item; receiving inspection (QP.20);
:Deliver to workshop (F219, <=5 days);
|MIS|
:Register job (F125); assign ATP;
|ATP|
:Retrieve manual / WI (F175);
:Tear-down inspection (F116, <=5 days);
if (Disposition?) then (BER)
  |MM / SMM|
  :Prepare Quotation (F119) + Defect (F135);
  :Obtain customer indent; procure replacement;
  :Issue F231 / F232;
elseif (SOR) then (yes)
  |MM / SMM|
  :Complete & forward SOR form;
elseif (beyond capability) then (yes)
  |MM / SMM|
  :Route to Outside Vendor (see 5.4);
else (normal repair)
  |MM / SMM|
  :Raise RFQ for spares;
  |ATP|
  :Raise Internal Demand (F212);
  |MM / SMM|
  :Submit TDI / Quotation (F116/F119);
  |ATP|
  :Carry out maintenance (under MIS);
endif
|MIS|
:Final inspection & testing;
|ATP|
:Complete documentation
(F114/F114A/F117/F111/F174);
|MM / SMM|
:Approve documentation;
|Stores|
:Deliver item; Invoice (F311), DN (F218);
:Return serviceable item to customer;
stop
@enduml
